#% title
# hypergeometric_2f1_regularized

#% text
# `hypergeometric_2f1_regularized(a, b, c, z)` gives `hypergeometric_2f1(a, b, c, z)` divided by gamma of its last lower parameter.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Finite also where the lower parameter is a pole of gamma.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
hypergeometric_2f1_regularized(1, 2, 3, 0.5)
#% output
#= 0.7725887222397813

